Package: mesa-demos
Name: Mesa GL demo utilities
Version: @DEB_MESA_DEMOS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libgl1, libglu1, libglew2.2, libx11-6, libxext6, libwayland0, angle
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://mesa3d.org/
Description: GLX and Wayland OpenGL demo utilities
 This package provides Mesa's basic GL utilities for Xios, including the
 classic X11 GLX tools glxinfo and glxgears plus the Wayland/OpenGL ES
 gears demo es2gears_wayland.
